CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around bdev->bd_holder_disks
#164: FILE: fs/block_dev.c:1181:
+	if (list_empty(&(bdev->bd_holder_disks)))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

CHECK:AVOID_EXTERNS: extern prototypes should be avoided in .h files
#204: FILE: include/linux/genhd.h:306:
+extern struct block_device *bdget_disk_sector(struct gendisk *disk,

Function prototypes don't need to be declared extern in .h
files.  It's assumed by the compiler and is unnecessary.

